    "description": {
      "value": "This ordinary-looking hat allows you to cloak yourself in illusions. The hat casts a 1st-level illusory disguise spell on you. While setting up the disguise, you can magically alter the hat to appear as a comb, ribbon, helm, or other piece of headwear. You can activate the hat as a 2-action activity, you can activate it any number of times per day, and the illusory disguise is 2nd level."
